<title>USA: Kellstrom Industries Q3 net rises.</title>
<headline>Kellstrom Industries Q3 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>SUNRISE, Fla. 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>KELLSTROM INDUSTRIES, INC.</p>
<p>			    Condensed Statements of Operations</p>
<p>				(unaudited)</p>
<p>			Three Months Ended     Nine Months Ended,</p>
<p>			   September 30,	   September 30,</p>
<p>				  Pro Forma		Pro Forma</p>
<p>				  Combined (a)	     Combined (a)</p>
<p>			   1996	  1995	  1996	 1995</p>
<p>Net revenues  $ 6,462,088 $ 3,304,563 $17,650,915$ 9,569,530</p>
<p>    Net income     662,134     201,619   2,007,250    765,914</p>
